  "description": "NEKNIE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C43 H58 Dy4 F18 N4 O24,5(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.349-3.822 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.31-108.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H80Dy4F18N4O31. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
